# MailPilot — Project Context

> **Canonical source:** `CLAUDE.md` at repo root. When `CLAUDE.md` changes, update this rule to match.

## Commands

```bash
npm run tauri dev      # Tauri + Vite (port 1420)
npm run tauri build    # Production build
npm run dev            # Vite only
npm run test           # Vitest single run
npm run test:watch     # Vitest watch
npx vitest run <file>  # Single test file
npx tsc --noEmit       # Type-check
cd src-tauri && cargo build && cargo test
```

## Architecture

Tauri v2 desktop app: **Rust backend** (`src-tauri/`) + **React 19 frontend** via Tauri IPC.

| Layer | Location | Notes |
|-------|----------|-------|
| Rust | `src-tauri/` | IMAP/SMTP, tray, OAuth, Tauri commands |
| Services | `src/services/` | Business logic — plain async functions |
| UI | `src/components/`, `src/stores/` | Zustand stores, no middleware |

**Data flow:** Components → services (`emailActions`, `syncManager`, `imapSync`) → Tauri IPC → Rust IMAP/SMTP.

**Email providers:** Use `getEmailProvider(account)` from `providerFactory.ts` — never call Gmail/IMAP directly from components. Modify ops go through `emailActions.ts` (optimistic UI + offline queue).

## Key conventions

- **TypeScript strict:** `noUnusedLocals`, `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`; path alias `@/` → `src/`
- **Styling:** Tailwind v4 semantic tokens (`bg-bg-primary`, `text-text-primary`, …)
- **DB migrations:** Append only in `src/services/db/migrations.ts` — never edit old migrations
- **New Tauri commands:** Register in `src-tauri/src/lib.rs` + `capabilities/default.json`
- **Tests:** Colocated `*.test.ts`; Vitest globals enabled

## IMAP gotchas

- Message IDs: `imap-{accountId}-{folder}-{uid}` (not RFC Message-ID)
- Yandex/raw hosts: `prefer_raw_imap_fetch()` → single-connection batched fetch
- Delta sync: header-only fetch; bodies loaded on demand via `messageBodyLoader.ts`
- Thread actions with empty `messageIds`: provider resolves from DB by `threadId`
- IMAP auto-sync: only after folder prefs + first manual sync (`imapSyncPrefs.ts`)

## Sync

- Background interval: `sync_interval_seconds` setting (default **120s**), `syncManager.ts`
- Manual sync: **F5**, Settings → Sync now, EmailList header refresh button
- IMAP delta: `imapRunDeltaSync` — batched search + header fetch

